			<div ccp_infra_copy_id="7cec2124-3195-4f98-97a0-9320a1ea8678" ccp_infra_timestamp="1674836026600" ccp_infra_user_hash="2814663856" ccp_infra_version="3" data-ccp-timestamp="1674836026600" style="font-size: medium;">&nbsp;</div>

			<p>Beginning Algebra provides basic college level algebra concepts. This ccourse covers linear equations, inequalities, and polynomials. This course consists of a downloadable workbook with example equations, worksheets, and vocabulary, broken into six chapters.</p>

			<p>This course includes an original pdf workbook for Developmental Algebra w/examples and solutions, a guide covering how to teach the OER materials, and practice tests and sample exams.</p>

